        {"kind": "test", "name": "PrivateMemberAccessTests.FormatterForClassWithPrivateMembers(type: \"class\", version: CSharp7_3)", "outcome": "failed"}
      ],
      "suggested_fix": "Investigate why head emits an extra/changed generated file for these types (test isolation, static resolver state, or a real generation-model change such as C1), restore baselines only after the cause is understood, and do not merge with existing-test regressions."
    }
  ],
  "refusals": [
    {
      "topic": "Whether the new tests fail without the fix",
      "reason": "tests.fail_without_fix was not run for this revision (listed in not_run), so the \u201cfail without it\u201d clause of REQ-2234-N2 cannot be confirmed from evidence; the code strongly suggests the duplicate/mixed-key tests would crash on base, but that is not a substitute for the check.",
